{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Swing. Climb. Jump.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Swing through ropes and overcome obstacles.\u00a0It\u2019s all about timing and momentum.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3346790/extras/Anim2.gif?t=1743438961\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Simple to move, hard to master.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The controls are straightforward, but working with the ropes takes patience and practice.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3346790/extras/Anim3.gif?t=1743438961\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>What to expect:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Physics-Based Gameplay:</strong> Feel the weight and momentum.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Rage:</strong> Fail, retry, and fail again\u2014until you achieve.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i><strong>Replayable Fun</strong></i><strong>:</strong> Push for a smooth run and a faster time.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Challenging Environment:</strong> It is actually difficult.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3346790/extras/Anim1.gif?t=1743438961\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Grab the rope and see how far you can go!</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Learning to Fly","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3346790/135ddc8d7814489522900e1128f6f958539499a7.jpg"},{"name":"Top","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3346790/cd53060bc1d521af762ba57edf9daecd832726aa.jpg"},{